  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">M-Kopa is Africa?s leading connected asset financing provider, selling a diversified range of devices including smartphones, digital financial services such as cash loans and solar home systems in Kenya, Uganda, Nigeria and Ghana. Its products are sold through a ?pay-as-you go? (?PAYG?) model, requiring clients to pay an initial deposit followed by daily instalments via mobile money. As of today, the company has over 1 million active customers.</narrative>
  </description>
