   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">We first invested in M-Kopa in 2017 as part of a $55 million local currency debt financing facility alongside Stanbic, FMO and Norfund. This was a landmark deal in the off-grid energy sector, being the largest commercial local currency debt facility to date for a pay-as-you-go company. Since then we have provided further local currency debt financing, to continue helping the business to grow.</narrative>
